		}

		itemDef {
			name tournament_desc
			group gamedesc
			text "BRACKET\nA random draw sets the single-elimination bracket. Byes advance unpaired entrants. Both full lineups must be connected, in the arena and ready before play starts.\n\n1v1 TOURNAMENT\nAn even field of 8 to 32 verified players enters. Play all 10 scored rounds. Each elimination wins a round. Simultaneous deaths replay the round. At 5-5, play one deciding round.\n\nTEAM TOURNAMENT\n2 to 8 teams enter at a fixed size, from 2v2 to 5v5. Players respawn. The first team to 20, 30, 40 or 50 kills respectively wins. After 10 minutes of play, the leader wins. If tied, play until one team takes the lead.\n\nRECONNECTS AND RESERVES\nA missing player pauses play. Each player has 5 minutes to reconnect in 1v1. Each team has 10 minutes to reconnect or fill the slot with a registered reserve from its own team. Repeat drops use the remaining time. Everyone readies again when the lineup is complete. Time expiry forfeits the match. If both sides expire, both are eliminated."
			type ITEM_TYPE_TEXTSCROLL
			rect 235 148.892 360 261.486
			font 4
			textscale .85
			textalignx 7
			textaligny 12
			forecolor .85 .92 .96 1
			lineHeight 13
			visible 0
		}

